I improved sqrt routine and it's faster than last week's version.
(55% faster than glibc's assembler routine, 35% faster than libffm's
sqrt, 20% faster than last week's version)

Now it's a little bit more accurate than libffm's sqrt.  If you want
precise value, you must add a few instructions with slowness.

