We've seen this problem with the onboard ethernet (but not with cards...)
The solution was to get a patched tulip driver from:

  ftp://ftp.ens-lyon.fr/pub/users/LIP/krisrose/Debian/Alpha/Miata/


and compile it as a module with autoloading.  Finally add this to
/etc/conf.modules or /etc/modules.conf:

  alias eth0 tulip        # Ethernet on M/B
  options tulip options=11

Good luck,
  Rob.


