This is :

the diff reveales that

> spinlock_t dma_spin_lock = SPIN_LOCK_UNLOCKED;

is the only change made in the dma.c file so add an ifdef for __SMP__ around
it and your compile problem is fixed correctly.

For the hanging problem....
