I always do this (version numbers changed to protect the innocent):

cd /usr/src
mkdir linux-2.0.42
cd linux-2.0.42
gunzip < ../linux-2.0.42.tar.gz | tar -xof -
mv linux/* .
rmdir linux # (now empty)
vi Makefile # edit ARCH and SMP lines
make config
...
