According to a reference from DEC's OEM site, 

164SX: Cypress CY82C693U-NC I/O chip incorporating:
	PCI-to-ISA bridge
	PCI IDE
	PCI USB

164LX: PCI-to-ISA brdige using an Intel 82378ZB Saturn I/O Chip
	PCI IDE using CMD PCI0646



