if you reply NO to that line (NCR53c7,8xx), then the next line will ask
about NCR53C8XX.  Since the drivers are mutually exclusive, answering Yes to
the c7,8xx driver precludes the option to use the 8xx driver at all.

This is actually a continual source of confusion.  It would probably be a
good idea to change the label for the 7xx driver or in someway indicate to
people that both are there.  Is anyone even using the 7xx driver??  On 825
boards perhaps?

