I don't know about the XL-T4. I'm using the  3c905B TX with kernel 
2.1.125, and the update driver from  Donald Becker, see 
http://cesdis.gsfc.nasa.gov/linux/drivers/vortex.html,

With the 3c905B TX (not the 3c905 TXb) It won't auto negotiate properly 
with my Cisco 2924 10/100 switch. So I force it by using it as a module 
and in the /etc/conf.modules add the lines  
#alias eth0             de4x5 
alias eth0             3c59x
options 3c59x           options=0x04 



