Hi,
  I've just upgraded to RH5.1 - and besides the general head banging here
are some insites:

  1) The addendum manual doesn't cover AlphaBIOS - only Arc.
  2) The milo/images directory on the CD is empty.
  3) If you boot to upgrade off the CD and your root filesystem
     contains a /etc/fstab containing a mount to anything other than under
     the root directory it will crash because it cant mount it.
  4) Upgrading to the latest glibc means you can get a guile which
works!!!

Dave

